working, even if it wasn't. And so what they did is they took all of the

00:22:28.580 --> 00:22:34.780
reporting cables that Ali Soufan had written, retyped them in the CIA's

00:22:34.780 --> 00:22:39.660
database, sent them back to CIA headquarters, and said, oh my god,

00:22:39.660 --> 00:22:44.340
look, we only waterboarded him one time. And look what he told us. He gave

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:48.860
us the kitchen sink. He gave us Khaled Sheikh Mohammed. He gave us the

00:22:48.860 --> 00:22:52.580
wiring diagram. Somebody should call the Germans and tell them they have a

00:22:52.580 --> 00:23:00.100
problem in Dusseldorf. Well, after a while, they had reported it.

00:23:00.100 --> 00:23:01.580
Which you had already done.

00:23:03.140 --> 00:23:05.700
No, I was out of it by then.

00:23:05.700 --> 00:23:08.860
No, I mean, but the Germans had already been called by the FBI?

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:15.860
Yeah. Well, I don't understand. By the way, there was a movie because the CIA was

00:23:15.860 --> 00:23:23.860
very involved in the making of the Zero Dog fairy. And there was even a report,

