CIA's Office of Public Affairs went back and not just redacted the names of

00:24:50.860 --> 00:24:59.980
the SEALs, but they redacted 27 lines of otherwise classified information. Again,

00:24:59.980 --> 00:25:03.220
that was in violation of the Espionage Act, but there was never any price to

00:25:03.220 --> 00:25:08.740
