the Inspector General's report, they pointed out there was even

00:25:37.220 --> 00:25:44.260
chance about who would play Panetta, who would play other people. And I have

00:25:44.300 --> 00:25:48.500
to point out because I didn't do it in the introduction. You refused to

00:25:48.500 --> 00:25:52.860
participate in the torture program or be trained for it. They asked you to do it.

00:25:52.860 --> 00:25:59.100
And you became a critic of the program after leaving the CIA. And you are the

