only person who has served time for being and having any connection with

00:26:04.620 --> 00:26:08.980
the CIA and torture program, not that you tortured anyone, but because you

00:26:09.060 --> 00:26:14.660
are accused of having revealed some and then you served just about two years.

00:26:14.700 --> 00:26:19.540
Yes. In prison. That's right. And you know, it's funny. When I got out of

