people. I'm glad that I did what I did and talk who had been tortured who had

00:27:07.340 --> 00:27:12.220
been tortured. That's right. And talking to the New York Times and and the and

00:27:12.220 --> 00:27:17.780
ABC News is is not espionage. Sorry, it's just not.

00:27:19.460 --> 00:27:24.580
Well, it's good to know that despite prison and being the only person who had

