They didn't know Arabic. They didn't know what they didn't know anything

00:28:44.460 --> 00:28:50.100
about the countries or culture or anything. Right. Not a thing. Yeah. And

00:28:50.100 --> 00:28:56.620
yet, going to what mass media does amazingly, this movie gave them and

